    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300104/1023001040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんでも楽しくこなしてる雛菜はすごいと思うし、\r\n才能も感じる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最初にも言ったとおり、期待してるんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001040070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "やは～♡　雛菜もそう思う～～～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300104/1023001040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……だけど、雛菜には\r\n心配なところもあるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "fade_out"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001040080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～～～\r\n……何それ～？",
